+
+## Transcript following
+
+New messages and streaming responses follow the newest message after layout updates. Dragging the transcript or conversation window interrupts following. Reviewing older messages keeps the reading position; a circular liquid-glass down-arrow appears at the bottom of the transcript. Click it to jump to the latest message and resume following. Releasing a transcript drag at the bottom also resumes following.
